    },
    "message": "Let the kernel answer for a namespace that is really absent\n\nA world without staff_dynamics_v1 has no row, and its kernel says so. Only a row left behind by a\nwrite past the table must not answer.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
