    "message": "Take the shadow of the per-tick check past absent namespaces and uncopyable worlds\n\nA world without staff_dynamics_v1 has nothing to compare, and deepcopy cannot copy a world's event\npayloads, so the probes break a restored copy.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
